          "-                    <div class=\"item-description\">",
          "-                        The 2026 AI programming tool ecosystem has evolved from simple code completion to complete autonomous development workflows. Key trends: 1) Terminal-native agents with Claude Code as the \"current ceiling,\" 2) Specification-driven development, 3) Full-process intelligence with Cursor, Trae, and Base44, 4) Enhanced integration via MCP servers and llms.txt, 5) Open-source tools like OpenCode, Aider, and Continue leading.",
          "-                    </div>",
