          "-                    </div>",
          "-                </div>",
          "-",
          "-                <div class=\"item\">",
          "-                    <div class=\"item-title\">",
          "-                        <a href=\"https://techcrunch.com/2026/05/08/airbnb-says-ai-now-writes-60-of-its-new-code/\" target=\"_blank\">Airbnb: AI writes 60% of new code</a>",
          "-                    </div>",
          "-                    <div class=\"item-meta\">",
          "-                        <span class=\"tag\">Technical</span>",
          "-                        <span class=\"tag\">2026-05-08</span>",
          "-                    </div>",
          "-                    <div class=\"item-description\">",
          "-                        Airbnb revealed in Q1 2026 earnings that 60% of code their engineers produced was written by AI - echoing similar comments from Google, Microsoft, and Spotify. CEO Brian Chesky explained that AI gives huge leverage: where previously a team of 20 engineers was needed, now an engineer can spin up agents to do work under supervision. Customer support AI bot now handles 40% of issues without human escalation.",
          "-                    </div>",
          "-                    <div class=\"quote\">",
